 "sentences": [
  "Earth’s tilt creates our changing seasons.",
  "A massive collision 4.5 billion years ago tilted our planet by 23.5 degrees.",
  "NASA’s EPIC camera captures this tilt from 1 million miles away.",
  "In June, the Northern Hemisphere leans toward the Sun for longer days.",
  "By December, the Southern Hemisphere leans into the sunlight.",
  "These images show our continents shifting positions throughout the year."
